3050 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Hello\054 Prospective TGS Student\041\240\n\nThe application process at THINK Global School \050TGS\051 is designed to determine if the educational goals of both the prospective student\057family and the school are compatible\056\240\n\nAs part of your application to TGS\054 we want to provide your family with information to help you understand what project\055based learning looks like at TGS\056 Please review this entire document\054 which gives you the background to conduct your own PBL research as part of our application process\056\n\nA Curriculum Designed for the 21st Century\n\nThe TGS Curriculum is non\055traditional and based on some of the most innovative pedagogical practices in the world\056 Due to this\054 all students and families must be aware of how they\047ll be learning at TGS\056\n\nAt TGS\054 learning isn\031t based on traditional one\055hour classes\056 Instead\054 our students learn by participating in themed project modules that allow them to craft their own approach to driving questions and engage with the communities in which they are living\056\n\nThese multi\055disciplinary modules allow our students to explore relevant real\055world issues by engaging with guest speakers and local community members\056 \n\n\n)
     /K [ 0 ]
     /P 3051 0 R
     /Pg 652 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

