  << /ActualText (Learning Driven by Values\050\nTGS\031s Core Values guide learning inside and outside the classroom\056 These eight global values are the inspiration for all that we do\072 \050Compassion\072 Consider others\031 needs and challenges with heartfelt curiosity and a genuine desire to offer support and kindness\056\nSisu \050Finnish\051\072 Extraordinary determination and resilience in the face of adversity\056\nKaizen \050Japanese\051\072 Continually improve \023 be self\055aware\054 responsible\054 and disciplined\056\nMeraki \050Greek\051\072 Put all of yourself \023 your soul\054 creativity and love \023 into your work\056\nPixki \034The Guardian\035 \050N\341huatl\051\072 Modifying your actions to protect the environment while adopting a more sustainable lifestyle\056\nQi\372 Zhi Y\371 \050Mandarin\051\072 Thirst for knowledge \023 be open\054 be curious\054 and challenge assumptions\056\nSatya \050Sanskrit\051\072 Live truth \023 in a way that is honest\054 steadfast\054 and uplifting to others\056\nUbuntu \050Zulu\051\072 Connect to a greater whole \023 in mutual support and community\056)
     /K [ 1 ]
