3055 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Section 1\072 What is Project\055Based Learning\077\n\nProject\055based learning \050PBL\051 is an innovative and immersive educational approach that diverges from traditional classroom learning\056 Instead of learning passively\054 you\047ll be actively engaged in solving real\055world problems through themed projects designed by our team of educators and\054 at times\054 by yourself\056\n\nHere\047s what you need to know about PBL at TGS\072\n\nReal\055World Focus\072 TGS projects are centered around real\055world topics and issues\054 making learning more relevant and engaging\056\050\nAn Interdisciplinary Approach\072 You\047ll integrate knowledge from different subjects to develop a well\055rounded engagement with complex questions and challenges\056\050\nStudent\055Driven\072 You\047ll have the autonomy to decide how to approach the project\056 This encourages creativity\054 critical thinking\054 and ownership of your learning\056\050\nPlace\055Based Education\072 Your learning derives from the unique places you live throughout your time at TGS\054 with a deep respect for engaging with local knowledge and actively participating in local communities\056 \050\nReflection and Assessment\072 Throughout all stages of the project\054 you will participate in reflections\054 feedback loops\054 and iterations\056 This helps in recognizing what you have learned and areas where you can improve\056\050\nDevelopment of 21st\055Century Skills\072 PBL at THINK Global School is designed to prepare you for the future by developing 21st\055century skills like problem\055solving\054 communication\054 collaboration\054 and adaptability\056\050\nValues\055Focused Learning\072 TGS\031s )
     /K [ 0 ]
     /P 3058 0 R
     /Pg 1235 0 R
