  << /ActualText (The Process Portfolio\n\nA process portfolio is a journal encompassing a student\047s work\054 reflections\054 and documentation throughout a project\056 It acts as a dynamic record of their growth\054 skill development\054 and learning journey\056\n\nThe portfolio serves several vital purposes in PBL\054 including fostering reflection and metacognition\054 aiding in assessment and evaluation\054 ensuring documentation and accountability\054 and facilitating communication and presentation of the student\047s work\056\n\nIn closing\072 the process portfolio is a multifaceted tool that encourages students to take ownership of and engage deeply with their learning process\056)
