3119 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Section 4\072 Introducing the PBL Challenge\n\nCongrats on making it this far\041 Now let\047s bring on the challenge\041\n\nThe PBL Challenge aims to assess prospective students\047 comprehensive understanding of project\055based learning in preparation for their time at THINK Global School\056 We do not expect perfection\054 but we expect to see critical thinking\054 creativity\054 comprehension\054 research methods\054 mastery of digital tools\054 time management\054 and planning skills to complete the challenge we have in place\056\240We want you to commit time and energy to this project\054 but we ask that you spend no more than 10 hours developing this project\056\n\nReady to take the challenge\077 Here we go\056 G\050\nThe PBL Challenge\072 Creating an Innovation for a Better Future\n\n1\056 Design a project around the following driving question\072\240\n\nHow can I identify a specific local challenge in my home community and create an innovation inspired by one of )
     /K [ 0 ]
     /P 3122 0 R
     /Pg 3047 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
