3121 0 obj
  << /ActualText ( to address this issue\077\n\n2\056 Create a final product in the form of a PDF\n\nThis is your chance to get creative and show us your best and brightest ideas\041 You do not need to go out and implement the innovation you are proposing\054 but you need to tell us about why your idea is a valid one to solve the local challenge you have identified\056\n\nYour submission\072\n\nMust clearly state what the local challenge is and the innovation you hope to create to address it\056\nMust be between 750\0551000 words\056\nCan include illustrations\054 videos\054 diagrams\054 photos\054 or any other items you feel will help explain your final product\056 This must be in addition to the writing\056\nMust define which of the TGS core values inspired the project and why\056\nMust share what skills you used\057learned while completing the project\056\240\nMust contain a reflection on how what you learned in this local experience could be applied in a global context or in a different global situation\056\n\nOnce Complete\072\n\nSubmit your finished PDF via the application portal in OpenApply\056\n\n\n\050\n\n\n\n\n\n\n)
     /K [ 2 ]
     /P 3122 0 R
     /Pg 3047 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
